  "details": "Shoulder animation/tracking has a bug that cannot be controlled using the VRC Animator Tracking Control component\n\nHow to reproduce the defect:\n\n1. Use the VRC Animator Tracking Control component, Set “Left hand”, “Right hand” and “Hips” to “Animation”.\n\n2. In VRChat (VR Mode), bring the controller close to the shoulder. You can see that the avatar's shoulders are not in “Animation” but remain in “Tracking” mode.\n\nExpected behavior:\n\nIf “Left hand” and “Right hand” are set to “Animation”, the shoulder movement will also follow the settings.",
